    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαγ-κέρως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>black-horned</i>, of
			Agamemnon, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				11.27
			</span></i> (lyr., the epith. being suggested by the preceding words,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπεχε τῆς βοὸς τὸν
			ταῦρον</span>): but cod. 
				Med.
			 is corrected to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαγκέρῳ
			</span>( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλανι</span>
			) agreeing with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανήματι</span>.</div>
